{
  "title": "Misión de Luca: explorar la Sagrada peluquería",
  "description": "docs/quests/luca.md. What is seen walking the mission, fights aside: Luca by the pond, in through the door, each zone of the salon, the queues and how they move on, the nave's mirrors turned one by one, what can be looked at, Fran on the presbytery. Run it with --gpu.",
  "steps": [
    {
